@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Historical / alternative. Dated observation or rejected/unselected alternative is preserved without becoming a current MVP topology.
title HISTORICAL / UNSELECTED — Hetzner provider context — dated input versus unselected facilities
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Hetzner Cloud context" {
 node "Observed demo guest\nNov 1 inventory: 2 vCPU / 4 GB / 40 GB\nNot a final placement or capacity result" as H
 rectangle "Candidate Cloud Firewall\nRules / attachment not verified" as FW #FFF2CC
 rectangle "Candidate private Network / subnet\nNot configured by this design" as N #FFF2CC
 rectangle "Optional Load Balancer\nNot selected / provisioned" as LB #EEEEEE
 rectangle "Optional attached storage / snapshot facility\nCoverage / cost / recovery not selected" as V #EEEEEE
 FW ..> H : evaluate actual applicable protection
 N ..> H : only if required
 LB ..> H : alternative ingress
 V ..> H : evaluate explicit data coverage
}
rectangle "Independent protected backup destination\nProduct/account not selected; backups not set up" as B
H --> B : required recovery design, not working transfer
legend bottom
 Named provider capabilities are options, not inspected account settings or purchase approval.
 Same-provider copies require failure/access-domain evaluation; snapshots are not assumed consistent or complete.
endlegend
@enduml
